# The Elder Bough: an ancient treant with a jack-o'-lantern face carved into
# its trunk, glowing from inside. It never moves.
size 13 16 9
voxel 0.1
colors
  b bark
  B barkDark
  o leafOrange
  r leafRed
  y leafGold
  g glow
# Roots and trunk.
box 1 0 1 11 1 7 B
box 2 2 1 10 10 7 b
# Branches reaching out, with a tuft of leaves on each tip.
box 0 7 3 1 8 4 b
box 11 7 3 12 8 4 b
box 0 9 3 1 9 4 o
box 11 9 3 12 9 4 o
# The autumn canopy: a stepped dome set back over the trunk, so the carved
# face stays visible from the game's steep camera.
box 1 10 3 11 10 8 o
box 0 11 2 12 14 8 o
box 1 15 3 11 15 7 o
box 0 11 2 0 14 2 .
box 12 11 2 12 14 2 .
box 0 11 8 0 14 8 .
box 12 11 8 12 14 8 .
box 0 12 3 2 14 5 r
box 10 11 6 12 13 8 r
box 4 15 4 7 15 6 y
box 9 13 2 11 14 3 y
box 2 11 2 4 12 2 r
# The carved face on the front of the trunk (z = 1): square eyes, a nose and a toothy grin.
box 3 7 1 4 8 1 g
box 8 7 1 9 8 1 g
box 6 6 1 6 6 1 g
box 3 4 1 9 4 1 g
box 4 3 1 8 3 1 g
box 5 4 1 5 4 1 b
box 7 3 1 7 3 1 b
